{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 44, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "x^2 + 1 with x = 2\n  = 5\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 44, "ok": true, "cmd": "substitute", "ucas": "substitute x = 2 in x^2+1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "substitute", "input": "x^2 + 1", "result": "5"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "x^2 + 1 with x = 2\n  = 5\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 45, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "monotonic x^2:\n  not monotonic on all real x\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in (-inf, 0]: decreasing\n    x in [0, inf): increasing\n  witness: x = 0 < x = 1 but f(0) = 0 < f(1) = 1 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -1 < x = 0 but f(-1) = 1 > f(0) = 0 (not increasing)\n  proved symbolically: x^2' = 2x; its real roots: 0 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 45, "ok": true, "cmd": "monotonic", "ucas": "monotonic x^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "monotonic", "var": "x", "verdict": "not monotonic", "on": "all real x", "intervals": [{"lo": null, "hi": 0, "direction": "decreasing", "strict": true}, {"lo": 0, "hi": null, "direction": "increasing", "strict": true}], "witness_not_decreasing": [0, 1], "witness_not_increasing": [-1, 0]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved symbolically: x^2' = 2x; its real roots: 0 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity"}, "files": [], "text": "monotonic x^2:\n  not monotonic on all real x\n  maximal intervals of monotonicity:\n    x in (-inf, 0]: decreasing\n    x in [0, inf): increasing\n  witness: x = 0 < x = 1 but f(0) = 0 < f(1) = 1 (not decreasing)\n  witness: x = -1 < x = 0 but f(-1) = 1 > f(0) = 0 (not increasing)\n  proved symbolically: x^2' = 2x; its real roots: 0 (exact); f' keeps its sign between roots of odd multiplicity\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 46, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "period of sin(x):\n  fundamental period 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307\n  proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 46, "ok": true, "cmd": "period", "ucas": "period sin(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "period", "var": "x", "status": "periodic", "period": {"value": 6.283185307179586, "exact": "2*pi"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)"}, "files": [], "text": "period of sin(x):\n  fundamental period 2*pi ≈ 6.283185307\n  proved symbolically: sin(x) has period 2*pi; x occurs only inside them, so f(x + p) = f(x).  Smallest: no p/k (2 <= k <= 64) is a period (checked at 997 points)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 47, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "identify x^2 - x^2:\n  polynomial of degree 0 (constant), leading coefficient 0\n  domain: all real x [proved: no partial operation]\n  continuous on its domain [proved: continuous operations]\n  parity: even: f(-x) = f(x) [proved]\n  periodic: constant [proved]\n  monotonic: constant [proved]\n  affine [proved]\n  bounded [proved]\n  values on [-10, 10]: from 0 to 0 [numeric]\n  injective: no, f(-10) = f(10) = 0 [witness]\n  zeros: everywhere\n  asymptotes: y = 0 (x -> ±inf) [numeric]\n  (numeric results are for [-10, 10]: x has no range; each property has its own command)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 47, "ok": true, "cmd": "identify", "ucas": "identify x^2 - x^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "identify", "input": "x^2 - x^2", "properties": {"domain": {"text": "all real x", "tag": "proved: no partial operation", "proof": "symbolic"}, "parity": {"text": "even: f(-x) = f(x)", "tag": "proved", "proof": "symbolic"}, "periodic": {"text": "constant", "tag": "proved", "proof": "symbolic"}, "monotonic": {"text": "constant", "tag": "proved", "proof": "symbolic"}, "injective": {"text": "no, f(-10) = f(10) = 0", "tag": "witness", "proof": "witness"}, "zeros": "everywhere", "asymptotes": {"text": "y = 0 (x -> ±inf)", "tag": "numeric", "proof": "numeric"}, "details": ["polynomial of degree 0 (constant), leading coefficient 0", {"text": "continuous on its domain", "tag": "proved: continuous operations", "proof": "symbolic"}, {"text": "affine", "tag": "proved", "proof": "symbolic"}, {"text": "bounded", "tag": "proved", "proof": "symbolic"}, {"text": "values on [-10, 10]: from 0 to 0", "tag": "numeric", "proof": "numeric"}, "(numeric results are for [-10, 10]: x has no range; each property has its own command)"]}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "identify x^2 - x^2:\n  polynomial of degree 0 (constant), leading coefficient 0\n  domain: all real x [proved: