{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 55, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "asymptotes of 1/x:\n  vertical: x = 0 (f -> -inf from the left, +inf from the right)\n  horizontal: y = 0 as x -> ±inf\n  proved symbolically: f = N/D with deg N = 0, deg D = 1; poles are the real roots of D that are roots of N of lower multiplicity (others are holes); at infinity the quotient of N by D\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 55, "ok": true, "cmd": "asymptotes", "ucas": "asymptotes 1/x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "asymptotes", "vertical": "x = 0 (f -> -inf from the left, +inf from the right)", "horizontal": "y = 0 as x -> ±inf", "proved_symbolically": "f = N/D with deg N = 0, deg D = 1; poles are the real roots of D that are roots of N of lower multiplicity (others are holes); at infinity the quotient of N by D", "headline": "asymptotes of 1/x:"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "asymptotes of 1/x:\n  vertical: x = 0 (f -> -inf from the left, +inf from the right)\n  horizontal: y = 0 as x -> ±inf\n  proved symbolically: f = N/D with deg N = 0, deg D = 1; poles are the real roots of D that are roots of N of lower multiplicity (others are holes); at infinity the quotient of N by D\n"}, "isError": false}}
